<title>USA: Price Enterprises sets initial $0.30 div.</title>
<headline>Price Enterprises sets initial $0.30 div.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Price Enterprises Inc said Tuesday that its board of directors declared an initial quarterly cash dividend of $0.30 per common share, payable November 15, to stockholders of record on November 1.</p>
<p>The company said its board of directors believes that current cash flows and favorable tax circumstances support the payment of dividends.</p>
</text>
